ue202https://www.jtechdigital.com/products/jtech-uhdt150-jtd-614-hdmi-extender-4k-60hz-hdmi-hdbaset-extender-over-ethernet-492ft?utm_campaign=openai_catalog&utm_content=product_card&utm_medium=feed&variant=41515170398292&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"OREI UHD-EXB400R-K HDBaseT HDMI extender kit\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn205616product21\",\"OREI UHD-EXB400R-K\"]\ue201**\n\n4K 60Hz \u00b7 Up to 400 ft \u00b7 HDBaseT\n\n## \\$164.95\n\nLong-range option with IR control and local HDMI loop-out.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View at OREI\ue202https://www.orei.com/products/uhd-exb400rk-hdbaset-hdmi-extender-400feet?utm_campaign=openai_catalog&utm_content=product_card&utm_medium=feed&variant=42195355566302&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"J-Tech Digital 4K 60Hz HDMI extender 230ft audio extraction PoC IR\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn205616product27\",\"J-Tech Digital 230ft HDMI Extender\"]\ue201**\n\n4K 60Hz 4:4:4 \u00b7 230 ft \u00b7 PoC \u00b7 IR\n\n## \\$98.70\n\nGood midrange choice with audio extraction and power over cable.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View at Best Buy\ue202https://www.bestbuy.com/product/j-tech-digital-4k-60hz-hdmi-extender-balun-over-ethernet-230ft--w-audio-extraction-poc-ir-black/J3GW774786/sku/11198824?utm_medium=feed&fs=tofrii&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n---\n\n\ue200image_group\ue202{\"query\":[\"OREI UHD-EXB350EAU-K HDBaseT 3.0 extender HDMI USB eARC\"],\"aspect_ratio\":\"1:1\",\"layout\":\"carousel\",\"num_per_query\":1}\ue201\n\n**\ue200entity\ue202[\"turn205616product4\",\"OREI UHD-EXB350EAU-K\"]\ue201**\n\n4K 60Hz \u00b7 HDBaseT 3.0 \u00b7 USB \u00b7 eARC \u00b7 LAN\n\n## \\$399.99\n\nPremium choice when you also need USB/KVM, networking and advanced audio connectivity.\n\n\ue200url\ue202View at Best Buy\ue202https://www.bestbuy.com/product/orei-4k-hdbaset-3-0-hdmi-extender-loop-usb-earc-lan-400ft-cat6-uhd-exb350eau-k-black/J3R8WXTSKW/sku/10957749?utm_medium=feed&fs=tofrc0&utm_source=chatgpt.com\ue201\n\n## Important: HDMI over Cat6 vs HDMI over IP\n\nThese are not necessarily the same thing.\n\n| Feature | HDMI over Cat6 / HDBaseT | HDMI over IP |\n|--------|--------|--------|\n| Typical connection | Direct Cat6 cable | Ethernet network |\n| Standard network switch | Usually unsupported | Supported by compatible systems |\n| Latency | Usually negligible | Depends on encoding |\n| Video quality | Often uncompressed or visually lossless | Often compressed |\n| Best for | One source to one TV | Multiple TVs, AV distribution |\n\nHDBaseT is generally preferable for a single long-distance HDMI connection. HDMI over IP is better for distributing video through an existing network. \ue200cite\ue202turn205616search5\ue202turn205616search1\ue201\n\n## Which one should you buy?\n\nMy first choice for a typical 4K home installation is the **OREI UHD-EX230A-K**, while the **J-Tech UHDT150** is worth considering for longer professional installations. Confirm the exact supported distance at your required resolution, HDR format and chroma setting before purchasing.\n\nOne question will help narrow this down\\:\n\nHow will you connect it?\n\nDirect Cat6 cable between two devices\n\nThrough an existing Ethernet network/switch\n\nMaximum cable distance\n\nUnder 100 ft\n\n100\u2013300 ft\n\nOver 300 ft\n\nVideo resolution\n\n1080p\n\n4K 60Hz\n\n4K 120Hz\n\n[Find the best match]"},{"p":"/message/metadata/model_dil_v2/recoveryDiagnostics","o":"remove"}]}       

